1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,330
This is the implementation demo for journey eleven.

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:07,190
It is the real application and API running on this machine,

3
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:12,420
with synthetic people and the local mail adapter, so nothing is charged or sent.

4
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:16,730
It shows a mechanic's repair estimate becoming the buyer's report.

5
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:21,620
After the call, the mechanic opens the estimate editor.

6
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,930
Each finding is added in a dialog.

7
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:28,010
A cost range with the high end below the low end is refused,

8
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:29,650
and the dialog says why.

9
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,210
Corrected, it is added.

10
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:36,040
The mechanic lists the brake pads, the tires, the steering that passes,

11
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,330
and a worn bushing.

12
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:41,960
Each has a status and a cost range, or a dash when there is no cost.

13
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:45,770
Submit estimate sends it, and the buyer can read it now.

14
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:49,930
The buyer opens the report from the inspection.

15
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:53,450
At the top is the cost to get the car safety certified,

16
00:00:53,450 --> 00:00:55,820
built from the required repairs only.

17
00:00:55,820 --> 00:01:01,070
Below it, the asking price and the all-in total show whether the deal is worth it.

18
00:01:01,070 --> 00:01:04,720
Every finding shows its status in words, not just colour.

19
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:08,690
The page says this is not a safety certificate or a guarantee.

20
00:01:08,690 --> 00:01:13,560
The buyer downloads a PDF copy, and asks about a cost, which needs a reason.

21
00:01:14,710 --> 00:01:16,810
Now the buyer shares the report.

22
00:01:16,810 --> 00:01:20,290
The dialog makes a link that works for fourteen days.

23
00:01:20,290 --> 00:01:22,270
A mistyped address is refused.

24
00:01:22,270 --> 00:01:25,620
A valid one is sent through the local mail adapter.

25
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:30,610
On the right, a browser with no account opens the link and reads the report,

26
00:01:30,610 --> 00:01:34,560
with no names or phone numbers from the buyer or the seller.

27
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:39,690
Then the buyer turns the link off, and the same page now says the report isn't

28
00:01:39,690 --> 00:01:40,150
shared.

29
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,330
The server enforces all of this.

30
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:47,030
Writing the estimate before the call has ended is refused.

31
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:52,120
The buyer cannot write it, and a reversed cost range is refused with its reason.

32
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:56,000
A different buyer finds nothing, and so does an unknown link.

33
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,360
The buyer who booked it gets the PDF.

34
00:01:59,510 --> 00:02:01,260
Here is what to remember.

35
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:05,250
The mechanic writes the estimate once the call has ended.

36
00:02:05,250 --> 00:02:10,640
The buyer reads costs, an all-in total and a clear statement that it is not a

37
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,480
certificate.

38
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:15,120
Share links expire, and the buyer can turn them off.

39
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:20,220
Not built yet: the body shop findings, notifications, and comparing cars.

40
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:23,650
Next, journey twelve: conduct a body shop review.
